@page "/"

<PageTitle>WordKeeper</PageTitle>

<h1>WordKeeper</h1>

<p>
    Offline vocabulary trainer for learning and repeating English words.
</p>

<div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
    <NavLink class="btn btn-primary" href="words">
        Add and manage words
    </NavLink>

    <NavLink class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="practice">
        Start practice
    </NavLink>
</div>

<hr />

<h3>What this app will do</h3>

<ul>
    <li>Add English words with Ukrainian translation.</li>
    <li>Save examples for each word.</li>
    <li>Repeat words using flashcards.</li>
    <li>Track correct and wrong answers.</li>
    <li>Work offline as a PWA.</li>
</ul>